    {
      "id": "7e5f2296-c0ae-4831-9acf-f32eb25f9ea6",
      "name": "Bulk Export - Asynchronous",
      "description": {
        "content": "Asynchronous operations for exporting data in bulk.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "abbbebac-bd9f-461e-9dfc-66100ccd63d2",
          "name": "Create Export Job using SQL Query (Asynchronous)",
          "request": {
            "name": "Create Export Job using SQL Query (Asynchronous)",
            "description": {
              "content": "Create an export job using an SQL SELECT statement to initiate data export asynchronously.\n\nWorkflow:\n1. Create Export Job:\n  - Call the Create Export Job API.\n  - Receive a unique JOBID to track the export status.\n\n2. Check Export Job Status:\n  - Use the JOBID with the Get Export Job Details API.\n  - Poll every few seconds to get the current JOBCODE.\n\n   JOBCODEs and Meaning:\n   - 1001: JOB NOT INITIATED\n     → Export job acknowledged but not started. Retry after a short delay.\n   - 1002: JOB IN PROGRESS\n     → Export is currently being processed. Continue polling.\n   - 1003: ERROR OCCURRED\n     → An error occurred. Stop polling and investigate the error.\n   - 1004: JOB COMPLETED\n     → Export process completed. Proceed to download.\n   - 1005: JOB NOT FOUND\n     → Provided JOBID is invalid. Stop polling and verify the JOBID.\n\n3. Download Exported Data:\n  - Once JOBCODE is 1004, use the Download Exported Data API to download the exported file.\n\nLimitations:\n- Exported file will be available only for 1 hour after job completion.\n- Maximum 5 concurrent export jobs are allowed per organization.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "restapi",
                "v2",
                "bulk",
                "workspaces",
                ":workspace-id",
                "data"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "CONFIG",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) JSONObject with configuration to create a export data. (Refer `ExportJobConfigSQLQuery` schema). Value must be stringified and URL-encoded."
                }
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "key": "workspace-id",
                  "description": "(Required) ID of the workspace."
                }
              ]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "disabled": false,
                "description": "(Required) Organization ID (can be obtained using Get Organizations API).",
                "key": "ZANALYTICS-ORGID",
                "value": "<string>"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "GET"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "id": "7889277a-59a7-4334-a71f-d6e596faab4d",
              "name": "Successful bulk export response",
